📆 DAY 1: The JavaScript Stack (MERN Extended)

• Frontend: React (compiled via Vite into optimized static HTML/JS/CSS).
• Backend: Express.js (Node.js/TypeScript API engine).
• Stateful Databases: PostgreSQL (Transactional Core) + MongoDB (Unstructured Audit Logs).

🛠️ TARGET 1: Local Lab (Docker Compose)

• Architectural Blueprint: Multi-container software-defined local bridge network.
• DevOps Focus: Boot strapping execution order, checking database dependency readiness, and enabling local development hot-reloads.

Dockerfile.frontend (Multi-Stage Build)

dockerfile
# --- Stage 1: Build Layer ---
FROM node:20-alpine AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY . .
# Dynamic build arg injected by docker-compose
ARG VITE_API_URL
ENV VITE_API_URL=$VITE_API_URL
RUN npm run build

# --- Stage 2: Production Distro ---
FROM nginx:1.25-alpine
COPY --from=builder /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html
COPY nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
EXPOSE 80
CMD ["nginx", "-g", "daemon off;"]
Use code with caution.

Dockerfile.backend (Multi-Stage Build)

dockerfile
# --- Stage 1: Build Layer ---
FROM node:20-alpine AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
